        <p class="text-2xl font-medium text-gray-900 mb-8 italic">
          A Reebok treadmill is a licensed product, and that one fact explains almost everything a
          buyer runs into: model names that differ by country, warranties set by the local
          distributor, an official US store with no treadmills in it, and a long list of older
          Reebok machines built by a different company altogether. Whether you have searched for a
